          "rationale": "docs/usage-ledger.md tells operators to export VERILEX_USAGE_LEDGER, so before this guard every session run landed in the operator's evaluation data while the doctor still passed. Reproduced live, then re-driven with the guard: an outside path is refused, a path under the session is accepted. scripts/ci smoke and canary pass with it.",
