          "summary": "The Report section fixes the report order and the attack line format with safe: held or safe: broken.",
          "rationale": "The zero-trust review contract (ZT-ATTACK-7) points missing scenarios back at this skill, so the skill must say what a run reports. A report without attack lines is not a pass, because watching only the happy path breaks nothing.",
